MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=0
RELEASE_VERSION=0
DEV_PHASE=1
DESCRIPTION=Major release 4.0.0 after 3.3.0: treat the prior 3.3 line as superseded by this milestone semver. Repository policy no longer requires CodeRabbit or Codex CLIs, install attempts, triage gates, or a no-push rule tied to those tools; use normal GitHub review and optional integrations the maintainers enable. Optional DEV_PHASE in .ver files tracks develop-phase D for the same A.B.C (not emitted in version_def.h); bump with scripts/bump_dev_phase_in_ver.sh; run scripts/strip_dev_phase_from_ver_trees.sh before merging version files into main (CI enforces no DEV_PHASE on main).
